{"html_text": {"ja435:0.1": "<article id='ja435'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja435:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja435:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja435:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja435:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja435:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja435:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja435:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja435:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja435:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja435:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja435:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja435:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja435:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja435:10.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja435:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja435:0.2": "Navakanipāta ", "ja435:0.3": "Gijjhavagga ", "ja435:0.4": "9. Haliddirāgajātaka ", "ja435:1.1": "“Sutitikkhaṁ araññamhi, ", "ja435:1.2": "pantamhi sayanāsane; ", "ja435:1.3": "Ye ca gāme titikkhanti, ", "ja435:1.4": "te uḷāratarā tayā”. ", "ja435:2.1": "“Araññā gāmamāgamma, ", "ja435:2.2": "kiṁsīlaṁ kiṁvataṁ ahaṁ; ", "ja435:2.3": "Purisaṁ tāta seveyyaṁ, ", "ja435:2.4": "taṁ me akkhāhi pucchito”. ", "ja435:3.1": "“Yo te vissāsaye tāta, ", "ja435:3.2": "vissāsañca khameyya te; ", "ja435:3.3": "Sussūsī ca titikkhī ca, ", "ja435:3.4": "taṁ bhajehi ito gato. ", "ja435:4.1": "Yassa kāyena vācāya, ", "ja435:4.2": "manasā natthi dukkaṭaṁ; ", "ja435:4.3": "Urasīva patiṭṭhāya, ", "ja435:4.4": "taṁ bhajehi ito gato. ", "ja435:5.1": "Yo ca dhammena carati, ", "ja435:5.2": "carantopi na maññati; ", "ja435:5.3": "Visuddhakāriṁ sappaññaṁ, ", "ja435:5.4": "taṁ bhajehi ito gato. ", "ja435:6.1": "Haliddirāgaṁ kapicittaṁ, ", "ja435:6.2": "purisaṁ rāgavirāginaṁ; ", "ja435:6.3": "Tādisaṁ tāta mā sevi, ", "ja435:6.4": "nimmanussampi ce siyā. ", "ja435:7.1": "Āsīvisaṁva kupitaṁ, ", "ja435:7.2": "mīḷhalittaṁ mahāpathaṁ; ", "ja435:7.3": "Ārakā parivajjehi, ", "ja435:7.4": "yānīva visamaṁ pathaṁ. ", "ja435:8.1": "Anatthā tāta vaḍḍhanti, ", "ja435:8.2": "bālaṁ accupasevato; ", "ja435:8.3": "Māssu bālena saṅgacchi, ", "ja435:8.4": "amitteneva sabbadā. ", "ja435:9.1": "Taṁ tāhaṁ tāta yācāmi, ", "ja435:9.2": "karassu vacanaṁ mama; ", "ja435:9.3": "Māssu bālena saṅgacchi, ", "ja435:9.4": "dukkho bālehi saṅgamo”ti. ", "ja435:10.1": "Haliddirāgajātakaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja435:0.1": "", "ja435:0.2": "", "ja435:0.3": "", "ja435:0.4": "", "ja435:1.1": "", "ja435:1.2": "", "ja435:1.3": "", "ja435:1.4": "te → yo taṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja4